  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assistance for access reforms</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assistance to quality assure and support improvements to the standard of the climate and nature plans identified as the basis for the trials. The technical assistance will enhance the skills and implementation capacity of the trial countries and support in establishing a new approach to climate finance access.</narrative>
  </description>
